      "en": "For my husband isn’t at home. He has gone on a long journey.",
      "ko": "남편은 집을 떠나 먼 길을 갔는데",
      "source_text_hash": "607c0f50b514ebbeb9f5bb85c32f0360757dae68d1ed6749711bac1263201283",
      "translation_text_hash": "4181a59590c0d0bb58c6d5fc45ed582abd03b45600ee080ef9853dbb64ee812d",
